{"id": "sevt_01VzhanWKxz1o43abDEFTpJS", "content": [{"text": "Confirmed \u2014 a single request (`req_efcce8808bfe`) fires many sequential `order_items` queries. 3320 such queries appear in the log, matching the per-order fan-out.\n\n**Evidence**\n- p99 on checkout jumps from ~75ms to ~3,900ms at **14:31**, exactly when deploy `a3f9c21` shipped. Error rate climbs to 25\u201365% shortly after as requests start timing out.\n- The diff replaces a single batched query (`OrderItem.objects.filter(order_id__in=ids)` + in-memory grouping) with a per-order query inside a loop \u2014 a classic N+1.\n- Log confirms: one request_id issues many sequential `SELECT * FROM order_items WHERE order_id = ?` calls; each adds up until the handler blows past its timeout and returns 500s.\n\n> **Root cause:** `a3f9c21` \u2014 the order-summary refactor turned a single batched `order_items` query into a per-order query inside a loop (N+1), driving checkout latency past timeout and producing 500s.", "type": "text"}], "processed_at": "2026-10-14T05:49:21.710113Z", "type": "agent.message"}
